      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MEAN APPROACH (1) made an ideal return when scoring by 1.5 lengths first-up at this track, showing a quick turn of foot to put his rivals away easily. He strips fitter for that outing and looks well placed to repeat the dose. SHOT OF WHISKEY (2) has been racing in stronger company recently, and he was impressive when digging deep to score at Doomben 3 starts ago. He has a good draw and is ready to show some good form again. Each-way. MISHANI EGO (6) was safely held last time but is capable of much better than that performance suggests, and she is worth another chance in this field. OBEROI PRINCESS (5) will be peaking third up, and she wasn't disgraced at the Sunshine Coast when sent out at long odds in a tougher contest. Include in all top 4 combos. NOT SURPRISED (7) has been bought out of a Victorian stable, and she resumes after an encouraging trial victory earlier in the month. She comes to hand quickly and has to be respected, especially if the money comes for her.",
